  "duration_seconds": 108.6,
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C01",
      "text": "距离血月降临，还剩二十四小时。楼下那条狗，把链子绷得笔直，对着西边狂叫。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fa43f2fff7b712f46d96adab6d92d3622eacf818c1f7be1c752c1f731cd34b60",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 231,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C02",
      "text": "夏凛站在窗边，只留一条缝。新闻在播，多地动物集体躁动，西南方出现红色云层。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d2a4ba1066c97bdb97f23c32758dc33631cece87cdcec688122f126a2d1d3579",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "start_frame": 234,
      "end_frame": 486,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C03",
      "text": "她说，我在部队见过这种动物异常。是地震前兆，不，比地震更糟。我问，你信我了？她说，我信动物。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c235f955ada9cbc3d8ad9f94028acfa1b3ae047769f712ce51cb8c4eedda6d8e",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "start_frame": 489,
      "end_frame": 783,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C04",
      "text": "我们最后试了一次院灯。门外台阶和楼梯转角，白光一亮，照得清清楚楚。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8526eecb9e0da4b4f608cc91cc37b469fa4167c38208c648dec8f4dc0d55d0c7",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "start_frame": 786,
      "end_frame": 990,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C05",
      "text": "傍晚，我路过超市，水和盐的货架已经空了。有人抓着最后一箱水，死活不松手。我什么都没买，我已经没什么可买了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fdd9f67034371a8b065eb770302f507a6651505721fdbdf1020b4cde7deb5e52",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 11.3,
      "start_frame": 993,
      "end_frame": 1332,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C06",
      "text": "我转身去了医院。许知意值夜班，我带来一箱纱布和消毒耗材，附上正规的票据。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b78be1680d5495a95fd77a5b1d0b3eaff91417cf48a612b1660f6134dabf6446",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "start_frame": 1335,
      "end_frame": 1569,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C07",
      "text": "她问我，到底出什么事了？我把倒计时给她看，又递上一张写着地址的纸卡。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6800e1277c024088207b3479eb385a3544463ba4eaafa007aa453454864ce724",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "start_frame": 1572,
      "end_frame": 1782,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C08",
      "text": "我说，明天晚上，无论发生什么，来找我。她说，我明天夜班。我说，那你，就从医院逃出来。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "290258dbd074183999051ad49575a6a6dedd5497eb96320e2d76e12ca53068d3",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "start_frame": 1785,
      "end_frame": 2079,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C09",
      "text": "她说，你在咒我的医院？我说，不，我在给你留一个位置。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "6f77ad81f0db3c598306e32e56da84ae283fdb868eed5f53531482fbca0dc08c",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "start_frame": 2082,
      "end_frame": 2256,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C10",
      "text": "她愣了一下，把卡片收进白大褂口袋。我看着那一角露在外面，才转身离开。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "82b524100dcc8c80e02fc1a6ebcc7fb4a31092d84237d28f95d43d72f39513ae",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "start_frame": 2259,
      "end_frame": 2481,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C11",
      "text": "回去的路上，王大富在群里喊，明晚请全小区烧烤，谁怂谁是孙子。配图里，新烤炉旁边的柜子半开着，一排金条，反着光。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "4c4b2ea1c676bc537753e6219e483a8eac31292d5384929a16d5d49d778a70d8",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 12.493469,
      "start_frame": 2484,
      "end_frame": 2859,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C12",
      "text": "我没回。夏凛握着短棍，等在门边，西边的红色，一直没有退。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fa6440b4cc1db8d33106e5d131b1792d9027134446957c1e0f0accccba07c69b",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "start_frame": 2862,
      "end_frame": 3054,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP009-C13",
      "text": "我关上外门，把院灯的控制器，放在手边。等最后一串数字，归零。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP009/audio/EP009-C13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "34ab8206a5237f6ff60ca742d570afe2e066382ab1ae48ff68abb2f07a435d3d",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.687375,
      "start_frame": 3057,
      "end_frame": 3258,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    }
  ],
